    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375940/extras/deea9edf01e3f57622f716a545196b27.avif?t=1750805865\" width=600 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frogz</strong> is a chaotic and fun multiplayer party game where players compete in a series of unique <strong>minigames!</strong> Customize your frog and dive in with your friends to test your skills in thrilling challenges. From obstacle races to epic naval battles, and even hide-and-seek games in Prop Hunt style. With gameplay that is both accessible and engaging, <strong>Frogz</strong> is the perfect choice for unforgettable game nights. Get ready for limitless fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frogz</strong> is a free to play, 3D Party Multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a variety of mini-games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+30 Maps all different.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game voice chat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your frogz.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frogz</strong> will always be 100% free to play, with no pay-to-win advantages and no in-game purchases to keep you from the action.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375940/extras/deea9edf01e3f57622f716a545196b27.avif?t=1750805865\" width=600 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frogz</strong> is a chaotic and fun multiplayer party game where players compete in a series of unique <strong>minigames!</strong> Customize your frog and dive in with your friends to test your skills in thrilling challenges. From obstacle races to epic naval battles, and even hide-and-seek games in Prop Hunt style. With gameplay that is both accessible and engaging, <strong>Frogz</strong> is the perfect choice for unforgettable game nights. Get ready for limitless fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frogz</strong> is a free to play, 3D Party Multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a variety of mini-games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+30 Maps all different.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game voice chat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your frogz.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frogz</strong> will always be 100% free to play, with no pay-to-win advantages and no in-game purchases to keep you from the action.</p>",
